<title>ESTONIA: KLEMENTI Q1 PROFIT 1.2 MLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>KLEMENTI Q1 PROFIT 1.2 MLN KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Klementi, a clothing company which debuted on the Tallinn bourse on Tuesday, had a net profit of 1.2 million kroons in the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>Klementi had a net profit of 4.3 million kroons in 1996, the company added in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
